{
  "schema_version": "argument_graph/0.1",
  "example_id": "persuade:D01060C5AE7D",
  "root": "u2",
  "units": [
    {
      "id": "u1",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 31,
      "text": "The Benefits of Online Learning",
      "role": "lead",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u2",
      "start": 33,
      "end": 97,
      "text": "Students would definitely benefit from attending online classes.",
      "role": "position",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u3",
      "start": 98,
      "end": 172,
      "text": "For most students, school is known to be a stressful learning environment.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u4",
      "start": 173,
      "end": 262,
      "text": "This makes it harder for students to learn and feel comfortable in what they're learning.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u5",
      "start": 263,
      "end": 342,
      "text": "If students had online classes, they would have more freedom in their learning.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u7",
      "start": 343,
      "end": 402,
      "text": "Also, students would feel comfortable and have less stress.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u8",
      "start": 403,
      "end": 476,
      "text": "Attending classes online would make students have a desire to learn more.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u9",
      "start": 477,
      "end": 530,
      "text": "Students would not only benefit from online learning,",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u10",
      "start": 531,
      "end": 572,
      "text": "but they would also enjoy online classes.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u11",
      "start": 574,
      "end": 687,
      "text": "First and foremost, students would benefit from online classes because they would more freedom in their learning.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u13",
      "start": 688,
      "end": 800,
      "text": "When students are at school, they tend to have a schedule and they're told exactly what to do and when to do it.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u15",
      "start": 801,
      "end": 900,
      "text": "From personal experience, I've learned that most students don't enjoy being forced to do something.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u16",
      "start": 901,
      "end": 1001,
      "text": "Being told what to do and when to do it, makes the learning environment more stressful for students.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u17",
      "start": 1002,
      "end": 1076,
      "text": "Therefore, the more freedom students have the less stress they'll receive.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u18",
      "start": 1077,
      "end": 1133,
      "text": "At school, students have some unreasonable consequences.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u19",
      "start": 1134,
      "end": 1223,
      "text": "If students did online learning, they would benefit from not having as many consequences.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u21",
      "start": 1224,
      "end": 1276,
      "text": "Student would benefit from having less consequences.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u22",
      "start": 1277,
      "end": 1387,
      "text": "Therefore, students should have the right to their freedom, especially when it comes to what they're learning.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u23",
      "start": 1389,
      "end": 1457,
      "text": "Also, students would feel more comfortable and enjoy online classes.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u24",
      "start": 1458,
      "end": 1565,
      "text": "The average student, plays sports or does extracurricular activities, making their schedule more difficult.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u25",
      "start": 1566,
      "end": 1633,
      "text": "Online school would provide students with a more flexible schedule.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u26",
      "start": 1634,
      "end": 1712,
      "text": "Students\u00a0would also be able to do and try new things outside of the classroom.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u27",
      "start": 1713,
      "end": 1773,
      "text": "Activities keep students engaged, making them want to learn.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u28",
      "start": 1774,
      "end": 1850,
      "text": "This also makes learning more fun and helps students further their learning.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u29",
      "start": 1851,
      "end": 1912,
      "text": "The less stress students have the more successful they'll be.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u30",
      "start": 1913,
      "end": 1984,
      "text": "Students can't have fun with what they're learning if they're stressed.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u31",
      "start": 1985,
      "end": 2052,
      "text": "Having a lot of stressful causes students to not do well in school.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u32",
      "start": 2053,
      "end": 2194,
      "text": "For some students, stress can be helpful, but for the average high school\u00a0student stress isn't beneficial and cause more issues for students.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u35",
      "start": 2195,
      "end": 2274,
      "text": "Students should be able to have fun and enjoy their learning for their benefit.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u36",
      "start": 2276,
      "end": 2322,
      "text": "Others may say online school isn't beneficial,",
      "role": "counterclaim",
      "stance": "rejected",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u37",
      "start": 2323,
      "end": 2389,
      "text": "but students are going to pay more attention and have less stress.",
      "role": "rebuttal",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u38",
      "start": 2390,
      "end": 2499,
      "text": "Students already don't enjoy the idea of coming to school everyday, and being told what to do and how to act.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u39",
      "start": 2500,
      "end": 2603,
      "text": "Some of the rules at school can be unreasonable for students causing students to get into more trouble.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u40",
      "start": 2604,
      "end": 2648,
      "text": "Online classes would take away that trouble.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u41",
      "start": 2649,
      "end": 2704,
      "text": "Therefore, making students want to learn and do better.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u42",
      "start": 2705,
      "end": 2809,
      "text": "If students were more comfortable in their learning environment, they would be more encouraged to learn.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u44",
      "start": 2811,
      "end": 2874,
      "text": "Finally, students are constantly stressed everyday from school.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u45",
      "start": 2875,
      "end": 2965,
      "text": "Making it difficult for students to enjoy what they're learning causing them to slack off.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u46",
      "start": 2966,
      "end": 3061,
      "text": "If students felt more comfortable in their learning environment, they would be more successful.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u48",
      "start": 3062,
      "end": 3128,
      "text": "Every parent and teacher should want to see their student succeed.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u49",
      "start": 3129,
      "end": 3185,
      "text": "Online school sounds like the perfect plan for students.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u50",
      "start": 3186,
      "end": 3246,
      "text": "Every student should be able to enjoy what they're learning.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "u51",
      "start": 3247,
      "end": 3350,
      "text": "In conclusion, online classes can beneficial to students causing them to have a more successful future.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    }
  ],
